# dist/ is the ncc bundle that action.yml executes. It is generated on main by
# .github/workflows/build-dist.yml, never edited by hand and never committed in a pull
# request — two branches rebuilding it from the same base produce divergent output that
# conflicts on every merge.
#
# linguist-generated keeps it out of language stats and collapses it in GitHub diffs;
# -diff keeps `git diff` from printing two megabytes of bundle.
dist/** linguist-generated=true -diff
